		"Name": "Shadow Hawk",
		"Details": "Starting with the Shadow Hawk SHD-2D as a basis, Davion engineers worked hard to solve the obvious weakness in the existing SHD-2D design, the lack of armor.   Having learned of other companies removing the AC/5 in favor of a Large Laser, Davion engineers decided to do the same to the SHD-2D.  At the same time, all heatsinks that were external to the engine were updated to Freezer experimental Double heatsinks to compensate for the increased heat load.   What emerged from this rework, was designated the SHD-2DrL and was a viable mech on the battlefield.",
